# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# A4 overrides: track the workspace/output/host and workspace/output/methods
# *source* (Cargo.toml, src/, etc.) so feature flags such as `circuit_debug`
# can never silently regress without showing up in `git diff`. We still ignore
# the build artifacts (target/) and per-feature Cargo.lock files.
# These rules come AFTER all earlier `output/` ignores so they take effect
# (gitignore applies later rules over earlier rules).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!workspace/
!workspace/output/
!workspace/output/host/
!workspace/output/host/**
!workspace/output/methods/
!workspace/output/methods/**
!workspace/output/Cargo.toml
!workspace/output/rust-toolchain.toml
# Re-ignore the build artifacts under workspace/output:
workspace/output/target/
workspace/output/host/target/
workspace/output/methods/target/
workspace/output/methods/guest/target/
# Re-ignore Cargo.lock under workspace/output (these are reproducible from Cargo.toml):
workspace/output/Cargo.lock
workspace/output/host/Cargo.lock
workspace/output/methods/Cargo.lock
workspace/output/methods/guest/Cargo.lock